                <invention-title lang="de">ELEKTRONISCHE VORRICHTUNG UND VERFAHREN ZUR BEREITSTELLUNG EINER BENACHRICHTIGUNG IM ZUSAMMENHANG MIT EINEM DURCH EINE ANZEIGE ANGEZEIGTEN UND IN EINEM SPEICHER GESPEICHERTEN BILD AUF BASIS VON BILDANALYSE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">DISPOSITIF ÉLECTRONIQUE ET PROCÉDÉ POUR FOURNIR UNE NOTIFICATION RELATIVE À UNE IMAGE AFFICHÉE PAR L'INTERMÉDIAIRE D'UN AFFICHAGE ET UNE IMAGE STOCKÉE DANS UNE MÉMOIRE SUR LA BASE D'UNE ANALYSE D'IMAGE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ELECTRONIC DEVICE AND METHOD FOR PROVIDING NOTIFICATION RELATED TO IMAGE DISPLAYED THROUGH DISPLAY AND IMAGE STORED IN MEMORY BASED ON IMAGE ANALYSIS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An electronic device including is disclosed. The electronic device includes at least one camera; at least one memory (130, 250) configured to store instructions; a display; and at least one processor (120, 300), wherein the at least one processor (120, 300), when executing the instructions, is configured to: acquire an image and a plurality of parameters associated with the image through the at least one camera, output a preview image (401) of the obtained image on the display, and while the preview image (401) is being output: in response to identifying that a posture of the electronic device (101, 102, 104) is maintained for a designated time, identify feedback based on at least some of the plurality of parameters, and display, on the display, guidance (821, 921, 1021, 1121, 1221, 1313, 1323, 1333, 1343) corresponding to the identified feedback.</p>
            </abstract>
